# One launch: a Quick Race with the Lamborghini Sesto Elemento, whose wheel archive sets rim
# PaintScale 2.0 and rim_V2 2.15 (Tire/Normal.xml: 0.65 both): which the race wheels upload.
# Menu strings: fm4-static-recomp tools/render_tests/routes.py; Lamborghini is manufacturer 36.
until START|A "root=\"B13EBABEBABEBABE\"" 240 0.6
until A "String: AUTOVISTA" 60 3
sleep 4
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
until A "String: QUICK RACE" 30 5
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
until A "String: MANUFACTURER SELECT" 30 5
sleep 3
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press LEFT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
press RIGHT
sleep 1
until A "String: CAR SELECT" 20 5
sleep 2
until RIGHT "String: Sesto Elemento$" 60 1.5
until A "String: COLOR SELECT" 30 10
sleep 2
until A "String: ASSISTS & DIFFICULTY" 20 8
until A "String: ENVIRONMENT SELECT" 20 8
sleep 1.2
until A "String: TRACK SELECT" 20 8
press A
wait "String: PRE-RACE" 180
sleep 2
until A "Input context: driving$" 60 3
wait "Present interval: 1" 60
sleep 1
shot sesto-grid
frame sesto-grid
